  "notes": "{解|と}く is a transitive godan verb meaning to solve, untie, or release.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes を particle for the object\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{問題|もんだい}→問題：00797_mondai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{解|と}く: to solve a problem\n- ⟦{紐|ひも}→紐：02251_himo⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{解|と}く: to untie a string\n- ⟦{誤解|ごかい}→誤解：02769_gokai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{解|と}く: to clear up a misunderstanding\n- ⟦{謎|なぞ}→謎：03505_nazo⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{解|と}く: to solve a mystery\n- ⟦{禁|きん}→禁：noentry⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{解|と}く: to lift a ban\n\nHOMOPHONE DISTINCTION:\nSeveral verbs read とく use different kanji:\n- {解|と}く: to solve, untie\n- ⟦{溶|と}く→溶く：26556_toku⟧: to dissolve (in liquid)\n- ⟦{説|と}く→説く：14245_toku⟧: to explain, persuade\n- ⟦{梳|と}く→梳く：27866_toku⟧: to comb (hair)",
